  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam Scotland Influencing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam Scotland is seeking to achieve progress in support of the Global Challenges (Valuing Women&apos;s Work and Climate Justice) and Rights Resilience and Response primarily through activities designed to influence the Scottish Parliament, in addition to activities in Scotland which complement UK and Global level influencing goals. These activities and project goals will be developed once the GC and RRR strategies are finalised.  This project will only host restricted (lightly or fully) funded activities.   However, in 2022/23 this will include a focus on advocacy related to the National Outcome on Care, as well as the funding of the Scottish Women&apos;s Budget Group, with other activities in development.</narrative>
  </description>
